{
  "name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "internal_name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "focus": "High-level Notional lending protocol architecture and end-to-end flows: external users and integrations enter through ERC1967/UUPS proxies and action/router contracts; governance and pause controls manage the implementation and configuration; trading, settlement, valuation, and liquidation modules operate on account balances, portfolios, markets, and nTokens; oracle and token interfaces define external trust boundaries; show control and data flow across these system boundaries.",
